  "teaches": [
    "Build a complete canal town from PrimitiveAsset and CompoundAsset kits around an imported character performance.",
    "Convert a Mixamo FBX into a Character1-bound MotionLoom Action with motionloom-action-tool.",
    "Ground a performing humanoid exactly on the pavement with a kinematic collider, an invisible ground Surface and floorSnap instead of hand-tuned heights.",
    "Build a sword from PrimitiveAsset parts and drive its native hand_r rig with the same Action as Character1.",
    "Cut from a high town overlook to a street-level shot of the sword routine."
